			'Gemorgen quickly responds by saying that he''s only joking before suddenly asking Igor if the two of you are dating.'
			'Igor visibly blushes and shakes his head. "We''re just friends."'
			'"You need to be upfront, son. Look at her! You might never get another shot with a girl like this. Don''t let this one off the hook."'

