						'"Well, you could say that the two of us have had some good moments," you reply while smiling at Igor. "Since Igor is inexperienced, we''re taking it slow, but I''m positive he''ll improve..."'
						'"Well, I''m sure you''re quite the teacher... I''m just glad Igor has found someone to look after him."'
						'You wink at Gemorgen before you grab Igor by the arm, and the two of you leave the living room, feeling relieved that you''ve told Gemorgen.'
						act 'Leave the living room': gt 'igorhome', 'hallway'
					elseif stat['think_virgin'] = 0:
						'"I hope something will happen soon. He''s been avoiding that part of our relationship..." you say, a little disappointed.'
						'"Don''t worry, I''ll have a talk man to man. He''s as innocent as a little lamb and probably doesn''t know what to do."'
						'Igor blushes while you thank Gemorgen for wanting to help out. The two of you then leave the living room.'
						act 'Leave the living room': gt 'igorhome', 'hallway'
					elseif stat['think_virgin'] = 1:
						'"No, I''m still a virgin and I''m not ready yet to lose it yet, but Igor is really understanding. One day maybe, but not right now..."'
						'Gemorgen looks a little disappointed at Igor, but doesn''t say anything since he doesn''t want to jeopardize the relationship.'
						act 'Leave the living room': gt 'igorhome', 'hallway'
