		'"I''m <<$pcs_nickname>> <<$pcs_lastname>>, pleasure to meet you. I love what you''ve done with your home..." you confidently say and begin walking towards her.'
		'She stops you in your tracks with a swift movement of her hand. "<<$pcs_lastname>>, you say? Are you by any chance related to Natasha <<$pcs_lastname>>?" she asks with a grin.'

