						'Inga sighs. "Who though my son would fall for someone like this... Well, I''m not too keen on this relationship you''ve developed, but if it makes my son happy, then I''ll have to deal with it. I assume you''ve already lost your virginity? Just remember to always use protection. I don''t want you becoming a father at your age."'
