	'"And who might you be?" she asks as she looks up. "What is that god awful outfit you''re wearing? You should tell your mother to buy you some proper clothes. I can''t believe that my sweet little Igor is hanging out with the likes of someone like you..."'

	act 'Try to be friendly':
