					act 'Leave the kitchen': gt 'igorhome', 'hallway'
				end
			end
		end
	end

	gs 'willpower', 'misc', 'self', 'medium'
	if will_cost <= pcs_willpwr:
		act 'You''ve had enough':
			*clr & cla
			gs 'willpower', 'pay', 'self'
			gs 'stat'
			'Tired of her yapping, you angrily cut her off. "A grown woman shouldn''t act this way. What does how I dress matter? Are you really that judgmental of someone you''ve just met?"'
			'"Where are your manners, girl? Hasn''t your mother taught you how to behave? You should be lucky I haven''t thrown you out. I''m a patient woman and don''t want to cause a scene with one of Igor''s friends."'
			'"I am well mannered. I simply won''t accept anyone bad mouthing me."'
			'"Well, you should think about how you present yourself. It feels like I should have a talk with your mother. Who is she by the way?"'
			'You think about whether you should tell her. "Well? Who is it?" she asks again.'
			'Without any hesitation, you say your mother''s name and see Inga''s face turn sour.'

			act 'Keep on arguing':
				*clr & cla
				'"No wonder you act the way you do! I should''ve expected that her children would behave like this."'
				'"What do you mean by that? My mother did a great job raising me. I bet she''s a better mother than you''ve ever been!"'
				'"I know your mother very well and I can tell you this; you''re behaving just like she did when she was younger. I won''t go into details, but I can tell you this..."'
				'Before she can utter another word, you cut her off. "I don''t want to hear it! I think it''s better for me to return to Igor."'
				'"We''ll see how long this relationship will last..." she says as she returns to her tea.'

				act 'Storm out':
					*clr & cla
					'You storm out of the kitchen, noticeably irritated that she got under your skin.'
					IgorQW['met_mother'] = 1
					pcs_mood -= 20
					act 'Leave the kitchen': gt 'igorhome', 'hallway'
				end
			end
		end
	else
		act 'You''ve had enough (<font color="red"><<will_cost>> Willpower</font>)': '<br><font color="red">You don''t have enough willpower to use this action.</font>'
	end
end


